      "POL-RD-09(4) billing-integrity review: the SGD 2.00 'Tuas South Avenue 8 loop' ERP line is charged although no GPS fix lies within the 250 m gantry-match radius (nearest fix 1,645.7 m) - a gantry the vehicle never passed."
